      "side": 1,
      "message": "Problem is very trivial. In watchdog_init() we are not waiting for IWDG_RLR register to be updated, which is fine (see comment in code), but step 2 of the test executes quickly and IWDG_RLR is still not updated when we are going to do hard reboot. Updating register without checking if pervious update was finished causes IWDG to ignore new value.\n\nI changed this patch. Please check if it is clear now.",
